---
import NoteFigure from './NoteFigure.astro';
---

<NoteFigure
  label="Figure 01"
  title="Reconstruct through a bottleneck"
  caption="Source-inspired diagram from page 1. The lower arrow compares the original input with its reconstruction; the latent code is an intermediate representation."
>
  <svg class="ae-wide" viewBox="0 0 700 250" role="img" aria-labelledby="ae-wide-title ae-wide-desc">
    <title id="ae-wide-title">Autoencoder: input, encoder, bottleneck, decoder and reconstruction</title>
    <desc id="ae-wide-desc">The encoder maps input x to latent code z. The decoder maps z to reconstruction x hat. A curved arrow compares x and x hat using reconstruction loss.</desc>
    <defs>
      <marker id="ae-wide-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M 1 1 L 8 5 L 1 9" fill="none" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.5" /></marker>
      <marker id="ae-wide-accent" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto"><path d="M 1 1 L 8 5 L 1 9" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.5" /></marker>
    </defs>
    <g text-anchor="middle" font-size="14">
      <text x="63" y="44">Input</text><text x="198" y="44">Encoder</text><text x="350" y="44">Bottleneck</text><text x="500" y="44">Decoder</text><text x="638" y="44">Reconstruction</text>
    </g>
    <g fill="var(--paper)" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="1.5">
      <rect x="29" y="76" width="68" height="68" rx="2" />
      <path d="M 145 70 L 248 94 L 248 126 L 145 150 Z" />
      <path d="M 452 94 L 555 70 L 555 150 L 452 126 Z" />
      <rect x="604" y="76" width="68" height="68" rx="2" />
    </g>
    <rect x="315" y="93" width="70" height="34" rx="2" fill="var(--paper)" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.8" />
    <g text-anchor="middle" font-size="24">
      <text x="63" y="118" font-style="italic">x</text><text x="192" y="118">f<tspan baseline-shift="sub" font-size="14">φ</tspan></text><text x="350" y="117" font-style="italic">z</text><text x="508" y="118">g<tspan baseline-shift="sub" font-size="14">θ</tspan></text><text x="638" y="118" font-style="italic">x̂</text>
    </g>
    <g fill="none" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#ae-wide-arrow)">
      <path d="M 101 110 Q 122 104 141 110" />
      <path d="M 253 110 Q 281 116 310 110" />
      <path d="M 390 110 Q 419 104 447 110" />
      <path d="M 560 110 Q 580 116 599 110" />
    </g>
    <g text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.5" fill="var(--muted)">
      <text x="198" y="176">learned features</text><text x="350" y="156">latent code</text><text x="500" y="176">reconstruct</text>
    </g>
    <path d="M 63 151 C 63 235 638 235 638 151" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.6" marker-end="url(#ae-wide-accent)" />
    <rect x="217" y="206" width="266" height="26" fill="var(--paper)" />
    <text x="350" y="224" text-anchor="middle" font-size="14" fill="var(--accent)">compare x and x̂ · reconstruction loss</text>
  </svg>

  <svg class="ae-narrow" viewBox="0 0 330 485" role="img" aria-labelledby="ae-narrow-title ae-narrow-desc">
    <title id="ae-narrow-title">Autoencoder reconstruction through a bottleneck</title>
    <desc id="ae-narrow-desc">A vertical flow goes from input x through encoder f phi, latent code z and decoder g theta to reconstruction x hat. A side arrow compares the original and reconstruction.</desc>
    <defs>
      <marker id="ae-narrow-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto"><path d="M 1 1 L 8 5 L 1 9" fill="none" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.5" /></marker>
      <marker id="ae-narrow-accent" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto"><path d="M 1 1 L 8 5 L 1 9" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.5" /></marker>
    </defs>
    <g fill="var(--paper)" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="1.5">
      <rect x="55" y="18" width="140" height="58" rx="2" />
      <path d="M 55 111 H 195 L 159 165 H 91 Z" />
      <path d="M 91 297 H 159 L 195 351 H 55 Z" />
      <rect x="55" y="393" width="140" height="58" rx="2" />
    </g>
    <rect x="90" y="210" width="70" height="43" rx="2" fill="var(--paper)" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.8" />
    <g text-anchor="middle">
      <text x="125" y="41" font-size="14">Input</text><text x="125" y="63" font-size="20" font-style="italic">x</text>
      <text x="125" y="131" font-size="14">Encoder</text><text x="125" y="153" font-size="18">f<tspan baseline-shift="sub" font-size="12">φ</tspan></text>
      <text x="125" y="199" font-size="14">Bottleneck</text><text x="125" y="238" font-size="23" font-style="italic">z</text><text x="125" y="273" font-size="12.5" fill="var(--muted)">latent code</text>
      <text x="125" y="318" font-size="14">Decoder</text><text x="125" y="341" font-size="18">g<tspan baseline-shift="sub" font-size="12">θ</tspan></text>
      <text x="125" y="416" font-size="14">Reconstruction</text><text x="125" y="440" font-size="20" font-style="italic">x̂</text>
    </g>
    <g fill="none" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#ae-narrow-arrow)">
      <path d="M 125 80 Q 120 95 125 107" /><path d="M 125 169 Q 130 178 125 186" /><path d="M 125 278 Q 120 285 125 293" /><path d="M 125 355 Q 130 373 125 389" />
    </g>
    <path d="M 201 47 C 300 47 300 422 201 422" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.6" marker-end="url(#ae-narrow-accent)" />
    <rect x="218" y="196" width="98" height="80" fill="var(--paper)" />
    <text x="265" y="219" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" fill="var(--accent)"><tspan x="265">compare</tspan><tspan x="265" dy="20">x and x̂</tspan><tspan x="265" dy="20">with MSE</tspan></text>
  </svg>
</NoteFigure>

<style>
  .ae-narrow { display: none; }
  @container (max-width: 580px) {
    .ae-wide { display: none; }
    .ae-narrow { display: block; max-width: 390px; margin-inline: auto; }
  }
</style>
